{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《2026香港小姐競選》定於8月30日舉行，早前首、次輪面試後選出12位佳麗入圍，曾被指為大熱的溫思婷就在次輪面試後被淘汰，但卻因一句「蕃茄醬牛腩麵」意外爆紅。無可否認，爆紅的原因或多或少是因港人取笑她的口音而引起，不過卻在歐陽萬成（Jimmy O. Yang）玩膠「學埋一份」的助力下，吸引更多注意。</p><figure><img alt=\"溫思婷最近更新了不少IG片。（ig@wencysiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260628/1147909328431222784098152.png/Jh4FTzZDBk54pibSsmhl1b0lgtFoUrZgBBCa6gQQmuo\"/><figcaption>溫思婷最近更新了不少IG片。（ig@wencysiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫思婷最近更新了不少IG片。（ig@wencysiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260628/1147909330645946368157492.png/EjQe4zZp-JmBVD17xoWB02I0-Dh0sSVuKZEJUCmRCVA\"/><figcaption>溫思婷最近更新了不少IG片。（ig@wencysiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2025年港姐亞軍施宇琪及季軍袁文靜和溫思婷合作拍片。（ig@wencysiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260628/1147909334790180864586204.png/4E5-OmgaoDgYBkuzPnOTv6Kv2xOfiflJQCyMO0AsjDs\"/><figcaption>2025年港姐亞軍施宇琪及季軍袁文靜和溫思婷合作拍片。（ig@wencysiii）</figcaption></figure><p>「師姐」施宇琪、袁文靜撐場</p><p>原來眨吓眼的功夫，溫思婷的Instagram追蹤人數已有1.4萬人。早前以淡妝出鏡獲網民讚「舒服好多」以外，最近更與多個網紅合作拍片，平均每條片都有過萬讚好，其中一條更有5.2萬讚好。日前她更與去年港姐亞軍施宇琪及季軍袁文靜合體拍片，學講急口令（繞口令），同樣受到網民歡迎。</p><figure><img alt=\"歐陽萬成（Jimmy O. Yang）都玩膠「學埋一份」。（ig圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260628/1147910781082275840254136.jpeg/GmJqHYngZyn4NcB5jd4FNWlOJ3I4IQJ7KbuFySm7hck\"/><figcaption>歐陽萬成（Jimmy O. Yang）都玩膠「學埋一份」。（ig圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫思婷素顏咪幾好睇。（ig@wencysiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260628/1147909332890030080219735.png/rBdPsnXyjcHKSXoq05_Pgd13tYG22xVyPOBWlDzgVpQ\"/><figcaption>溫思婷素顏咪幾好睇。（ig@wencysiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫思婷嘅ig followers人數升咗少少。（ig@wencysiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260628/1147909379014529024052498.png/55MP9Ho9xm0nQcWMnRwWkmlWDCSggKgbQx49u0MePbs\"/><figcaption>溫思婷嘅ig followers人數升咗少少。（ig@wencysiii）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T01:23:50.816408+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":502,"images":6,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}